        "description": "Deployed preview. Which funds look odd? Forensic screens: signals, not verdicts.\n\nFunds whose source re-filings (versao > 1) in the window reach min_restatements and min_rate_pct of their documents.\n\nThis playground selects `restatements` on `GET /screens`. See the [full resource reference](/api-docs/v2/reference/screens) for all variants.",
