            "description": "zombie_growth: the aging month-end (p_period). delinquency_drivers, restatements, late_filers: the window end (p_end). Default: the screen's own: zombie_growth the latest aging month; delinquency_drivers the latest complete FIDC month; restatements today; late_filers the newest month whose deadline has passed.",
